<title>UK: KfW unit sets A$100 million 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets A$100 million 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.25	MATURITY    16.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.56    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMS US/GB/AU/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
